==Spanish==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|es|la|bullīre}}, present active participle of {{m|la|bulliō|t=to bubble, boil}}, from {{m|la|bulla|t=bubble}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{es-pr}}

===Verb===
{{es-verb}}

# {{lb|es|intransitive}} to [[boil]] {{gloss|to begin to turn into a gas}}
#: {{syn|es|hervir}}
